    "description": "This dataset originates from an experimental design investigating both adult (Study 1) and child participants (Studies 2a and 2b, children aged 5\u20138). The dataset captures categorical variables (such as responses to knowledge and action prediction questions), reaction time measures, and a three-level certainty scale to measure participants\u2019 confidence in their judgments. also including gender, age,..",
